# BORGHERTZS_STRIKING_HANDS (jeuno 45): the two optional coffers' sections (status not available, main job MNK, the
# [AF]ZilartCoffer bit unset). Accepted by a GM, a level 75 MNK: Beadeaux's Treasure Coffer opens to TempleCyclas (the
# item bypass; the result is the item): [AF]ZilartCoffer +8 (bit 3); GarlaigeCitadel's to TempleCrown: +16 (bit 4).
lists Beadeaux/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade GarlaigeCitadel/Treasure_Coffer/onTrade
char zone=Beadeaux pos=-82.3,1.056,-140.1 job=MNK lvl=75
quest Jeuno.BorghertzsStrikingHands accepted
item BeadeauxCofferKey
item GarlaigeCofferKey
login
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer BeadeauxCofferKey x1 # bit 3 unset: TempleCyclas; [AF]ZilartCoffer 8
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
warp -282.3,0,263.2 GarlaigeCitadel
tick 13000                              # the coffer placed
trigger Treasure_Coffer                 # walks to the coffer
trade Treasure_Coffer GarlaigeCofferKey x1 # bit 4 unset: TempleCrown; [AF]ZilartCoffer 24
tick 4500                               # the coffer opened
